# Prebuilt libkcl binaries are not tracked on the development branches. They
# are ~350MB of compiled artifacts that only carry value for a pinned release,
# and every one of them is reproducible from the kcl-lang/kcl release of the
# same version. See docs/lib-vendoring.md.
#
#   local build / CI on main : hack/download-libs.sh
#   release/* branch         : .github/workflows/vendor-libs.yaml stages them
#   release tags             : cut from a release/* branch, so they travel
#                              with the tag
#
# The per-platform dummy.go files stay tracked so the packages still exist.
lib/*/libkcl.so
lib/*/libkcl.dylib
lib/*/kcl.dll
lib/*/libkcl.a
